 "description": "Born from the Pacific. Built for wherever \"Out There\" takes you. All-weather protection. Offshore performance. Professional capability. The Aquila 28 Molokai Cuddy merges intelligence with premium construction, extending your horizons with protection from the elements and unwavering confidence in challenging conditions.\nFeaturing a forward cuddy that provides shelter while maintaining aggressive offshore capability, this versatile catamaran excels in multiple roles. Its generous cockpit space makes it ideally suited for carrying passengers or serious fishing operations.\nWith Hawaiian spirit in its DNA, the 28 Molokai Cuddy conquers Pacific swells and Atlantic chop with equal poise. Configure it with available extended hardtop, roof racks, or center seating to match your professional or personal blue water lifestyle.\nWhen the weather turns but the mission must continue, the protected helm station keeps you comfortable and in command.\nBecause out there, freedom calls.",
